{"text": "SPARROWHAWK YOUTH WELLNESS CLINIC - TELEHEALTH INTAKE (ages 12-18)\nCompleted by: Noor Farahani, RCC        Date: Jan 14/26, 4:10 pm        Visit type: video (parent joined first 15 min)\n\nCLIENT\nName: Sidhu, Anjali K. (\"Anj\")        DOB: 2010-11-03 (15)        Pronouns: she/her\nPHN: 9698 658 215                     Chart #: SYW-22-01874\nSchool: Dunsmuir Heights Secondary, Gr. 10 (counsellor there: Ms. Pellerin, 604-555-0121 x 4)\nLives: Mon-Thu w/ mom at 14-6388 Hazelmere Crescent, Surrey BC V3S 2K7;\n       weekends w/ dad in Abbotsford. Parents separated since spring 2024.\n\nFAMILY\nMom: Harpreet Sidhu, cell 778-555-0109, harpreet.sidhu@mailbox.example - joined start of session\nDad: Gurinder Sidhu, (604) 555-0186 - not aware of referral; Anjali asks we not call him\nSibling: Kiran, 11, same school catchment (Hazelmere Elementary)\nEmergency contact if mom unreachable: Aunt Manjit Gill, 604 555 0174\nFamily Hx: mother treated for postpartum depression; paternal uncle - alcohol use disorder.\nFamily attends the gurdwara weekly; Anj says faith is \"mostly a mom thing.\"\n\nPRESENTING\nReferred by pediatrician Dr. Callum Sinclair (Dr. Sinclair's office fax 604-555-0140) for panic attacks at school\nsince September. GAD-7 score 15; PHQ-A score 11. Sleep 5-6 h. Skipped 9 school days this term.\nAnj disclosed she identifies as bisexual and is not out to her father. Disclosed\nsuperficial cutting, left forearm, last in November. Denies current suicidal thoughts.\n\nMEDS\nsertraline 50 mg daily, started Dec. 2 by Dr. Sinclair. Rx #7740-221867 at Fernbank Pharmacy\n(Fernbank delivers to mom's address). salbutamol inhaler prn for exercise-induced asthma. No known drug allergies.\n\nSAFETY\nReviewed safety plan. Kids Help Phone number given. Mom agreed to lock up her zopiclone.\n\nTECH\nSession via Zoom from client's iPad (9th gen), serial F9FXK2LMQ1, on home wifi; clinic log shows join from\nIP 203.0.113.58. Portal: sparrowhawkyouth.example/portal  username anj.sidhu09  temp password Maple-Otter-41\n(expires in 72 h). Mom has a separate parent login (hsidhu_parent).\n\nCONSENT\nMature minor consent assessed and documented per Infants Act s. 17. Anj does NOT consent to parents reading session notes;\nOK to share attendance and safety concerns. Declined consent to contact dad.\n\nPLAN\n1. Weekly video sessions x 6, Wednesdays 4 pm, starting Jan 21. Fee covered - sliding scale $20/session, not MSP.\n2. Psychiatry consult request to Dr. Louise Tremaine (L. Tremaine, MSP billing no. 62417).\n3. Letter to school counsellor Odette Pellerin re quiet-room pass - with Anj's consent, signed 14/01/2026.\n4. Next review 2026-03-04.\n\nNF", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "387 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Noor Farahani", "Anjali K. Sidhu", "Harpreet Sidhu", "Gurinder Sidhu", "Kiran", "Manjit Gill", "Dr. Callum Sinclair", "Louise Tremaine", "Odette Pellerin", "Anj"], "companies": ["SPARROWHAWK YOUTH WELLNESS CLINIC", "Fernbank Pharmacy", "Zoom", "sparrowhawkyouth.example"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Dunsmuir Heights Secondary", "Hazelmere Crescent", "Abbotsford", "Hazelmere Elementary", "Surrey"], "health": ["panic attacks", "GAD-7", "PHQ-A", "Sleep", "cutting", "asthma", "zopiclone", "Psychiatry consult"], "sensitive": ["postpartum depression", "alcohol use disorder", "bisexual", "suicidal thoughts"], "names": ["Noor", "Anjali", "Sidhu", "Harpreet", "Gurinder", "Kiran", "Manjit", "Dr. Callum Sinclair", "Louise", "Odette", "Anj"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.20000000298023224, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "s